        "text": "似乎传送到这里的不止你一人......还有...",
        "width": 1774,
        "height": 887
      },
      {
        "image": "res://assets/story_comics/master_delivery_20261004/furina_kettle_20261005.png",
        "text": "还有一位提着烧水壶自称水神的少女（或许）",
        "width": 1774,
        "height": 887
      }
    ],
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "n_muqzf5le_zgmfr",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "惊讶",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_惊讶_水滴瞳.png",
        "text": "嗯？这不是旅行者吗，你也是找厕所的时候进了奇怪的地方然后出不去了吗",
        "next": "n_mutxol0a_6894t"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxol0a_6894t",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "思考",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_思考_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "说起来在附近只能找到一个水壶，反正闲着也是闲着，先烧了水",
        "next": "n_mutxph0w_obciu"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxph0w_obciu",
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "思考",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_思考_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "怎么样旅行者，来壶开水充充饥吧",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "谢谢，芙宁娜可真爱干净",
            "next": "n_mutxv2cs_bf6ya"
          },
          {
            "text": "谢谢，我不饿",
            "next": "n_mutxyjmv_doe21"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxv2cs_bf6ya",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "害羞",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_害羞_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "虽然是很爱干净，但总感觉旅行者说话很奇怪呢",
        "next": "n_mutxwqwn_39ol7"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxwqwn_39ol7",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "害羞",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_害羞_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "也没什么事干，或许跟着旅行者能找到厕所",
        "next": "n_mutxy7ry_j9nqn"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxy7ry_j9nqn",
        "type": "ending",
        "status": "success",
        "unlock_character": "hero_03",
        "note": "芙宁娜加入队伍",
        "comics": []
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxyjmv_doe21",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "傲娇",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_傲娇_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "居然拒绝水之魔神芙卡洛斯的水吗",
        "next": "n_mutxzoo7_d17k5"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxzoo7_d17k5",
        "type": "ending",
        "status": "badend",
        "unlock_character": "",
        "note": "转场动画后回到最开始的动画",
        "comics": []
      }
    ],
